OL,3,GNEWSAPavement parking ban could be
OL,4,Aintroduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to ban motorists from parking on
OL,7,Fpavements could soon be introduced in
OL,8,FOxfordshire.
OL,10,FAn Oxfordshire County Council report
OL,11,Fhas recommended cabinet members vote in
OL,12,Ffavour of "preparatory work" for the
OL,13,Fenforcement at a meeting on Tuesday.
OL,15,FIt comes after the authority agreed in
OL,16,FJune to address "pavement, path and
OL,17,Fverge parking" due to the impact on
OL,18,Fpedestrians and other highway users.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
