OL,3,GNEWSAPavement parking ban could be
OL,4,Aintroduced
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the plans have been criticised by
OL,7,FConservative councillor Liam Walker,
OL,8,Fwho said: "What works on a city street
OL,9,Fmay make life harder in a village".
